# {{lb|en|nonstandard|proscribed}} Misspelling of [[spay]].

====Usage notes====
This misspelling of [[spay]] has become increasingly common in recent decades, particularly at some veterinary practices, to the point at which it is likely to become standard in the future. It may have been modelled on the [[grey]]/[[gray]] regional spelling variation.


